# Variáveis em http-client.env.json (ambiente "local"; a chave é a do perfil local do bootRun).

### 1. Criar job a cada 10 segundos (guarda o id numa variável)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ping-exemplo",
  "scheduleType": "INTERVAL",
  "scheduleExpr": "PT10S",
  "payload": { "url": "https://example.com", "method": "GET" }
}

> {% client.global.set("jobId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. Criar job cron: toda hora cheia, em horário de Brasília, pulando o que for perdido
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "relatorio-horario",
  "scheduleType": "CRON",
  "scheduleExpr": "0 0 * * * *",
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "misfirePolicy": "SKIP",
  "payload": { "url": "https://example.com/relatorio", "method": "POST" }
}

### 3. Criar job de execução única (ajuste a data para o futuro)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "uma-vez",
  "scheduleType": "ONCE",
  "scheduleExpr": "2026-12-31T23:00:00Z",
  "payload": { "url": "https://example.com/fim-de-ano" }
}

### 4. Buscar o job
GET http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 5. Listar jobs ativos
GET http://localhost:8080/jobs?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 6. Histórico de execuções
GET http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 7. Pausar
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 8. Retomar (a misfire policy decide o que fazer com o tempo perdido)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 9. Erro esperado: cron inválido (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "invalido",
  "scheduleType": "CRON",
  "scheduleExpr": "isso não é cron",
  "payload": { "url": "https://example.com" }
}

### 10. Erro esperado: payload sem url (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "sem-url",
  "scheduleType": "INTERVAL",
  "scheduleExpr": "PT1M",
  "payload": {}
}

### 11. Disparar o job agora, fora do agendamento (guarda o id da execução)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

> {% client.global.set("executionId", response.body.id); %}

### 12. Detalhe da execução
GET http://localhost:8080/executions/{{executionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 13. Cancelar a execução (PENDING ou RUNNING)
POST http://localhost:8080/executions/{{executionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 14. Retentar uma execução DEAD ou FAILED (409 se estiver em outro status)
POST http://localhost:8080/executions/{{executionId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 15. Métricas do Cronos
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 16. Apagar o job e todo o histórico (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 17. Erro esperado: sem chave (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/jobs

### 18. Erro esperado: destino interno bloqueado contra SSRF (400 fora do perfil local)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "metadata",
  "scheduleType": "ONCE",
  "scheduleExpr": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "payload": { "url": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data" }
}
